          "content": "A\n\nTaking the money produces the greatest net well-being. The financial relief prevents months of severe hardship, stress, and compounding debt, whereas the harm to the owner is relatively minor\u2014sacrificing a luxury vacation rather than any basic necessity. Because the money relieves far more suffering than the distress it causes, the overall balance of happiness over harm is maximized.",
